cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this header, cite nlohmann/json as below.
title: JSON for Modern C++ (nlohmann/json) v3.11.2, single header (vendored)
abstract: >-
  single_include/nlohmann/json.hpp and LICENSE.MIT of V-Sekai-fire/json (the
  org's fork of nlohmann/json) at tag v3.11.2, copied unmodified. skin-tokens
  asks for nlohmann_json 3.11 (its CMakeLists.txt: find_package(nlohmann_json
  3.11)) and uses it only in src/glb.cpp (host GLB I/O);
  tests/native/infer/CMakeLists.txt puts this directory on its include path
  as the nlohmann_json::nlohmann_json interface target. Byte-identical,
  modulo line endings, to the 3.11.2 copy the org's stable-diffusion-ggml
  carries in thirdparty/json.hpp, which the host build used before this.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Niels Lohmann
  - name: The nlohmann/json contributors
    website: https://github.com/nlohmann/json
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/json
commit: bc889afb4c5bf1c0d8ee29ef35eaaf4c8bef8a5d
version: 3.11.2
license: MIT
